@*
    Views/Shared/_ValidationScriptsPartial.cshtml — from the project template.
    Loads jQuery Validation, which can check forms in the browser before they
    are sent. It is currently not used by any page: all forms are validated on
    the server instead (ModelState in the controllers), which is always needed
    anyway, because browser checks can be bypassed.
*@
<script src="~/lib/jquery-validation/dist/jquery.validate.min.js"></script>
<script src="~/lib/jquery-validation-unobtrusive/jquery.validate.unobtrusive.min.js"></script>
